al_code":"746.2805(3)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"Prohibited Punishments - Grabbing and Pulling: Based on the preponderance of evidence of the investigation by DFPS, a caregiver has grabbed a child by upper arms and takes him out of one chair and moves him to another chair.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026692661","violation_type_title":"Prohibited Punishments - Grabbing and Pulling (26 TAC §746.2805(3))","topic_label":"Other"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240331-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2805-7","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240331","date":"2024-03-31","original_code":"746.2805(7)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"Prohibited Punishments - Placing Child in Locked or Dark Room: Based on the preponderance of evidence of the investigation, and observation by the Childcare Investigator from DFPS, a two year olds child was observed in a toilet for almost two hours.","topic":"sanitation","source_record_id":"1026696307","violation_type_title":"Prohibited Punishments - Placing Child in Locked or Dark Room (26 TAC §746.2805(7))","topic_label":"Sanitation & hygiene"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240331-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2805-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240331","date":"2024-03-31","original_code":"746.2805(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"Prohibited Punishments - Corporal Punishment: Based on the preponderance of evidence of the investigation by DFPS, a caregiver observer flicked a child nose.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026696306","violation_type_title":"Prohibited Punishments - Corporal Punishment (26 TAC §746.2805(1))","topic_label":"Other"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327","date":"2024-03-27","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":5,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905922246","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905922246","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2024-03-27","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1201-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327","date":"2024-03-27","original_code":"746.1201(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"AP Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Ensure No Child Abused, Neglected, or Exploited: This standard was evaluated at the result of the DFPS investigation, and the standard was found to be deficient as the caregiver was found reason to believe for physical abuse.  The caregiver was found flick children on the nose and mouth.  The caregiver was swatting children on the bottom and slapping them on the cheek.  There was bruising to a child thigh where the caregiver was observed to have grabbed the child earlier in the day.  Also, as the result of DFPS investigation and the standard was found to be deficient as the second caregiver was found reason to believe for neglect supervision.  The second caregiver in the classroom observed the behavior and prohibited discipline by the other caregiver in the room and did not intervene or report it to management.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026574455","violation_type_title":"AP Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Ensure No Child Abused, Neglected, or Exploited (26 TAC §746.1201(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2805-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327","date":"2024-03-27","original_code":"746.2805(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"Prohibited Punishments - Corporal Punishment: This standard was found deficient as part of a DFPS investigation.   A caregiver was observed on video to flic a child on the mouth and nose and slap a child in the face.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026574458","violation_type_title":"Prohibited Punishments - Corporal Punishment (26 TAC §746.2805(1))","topic_label":"Other"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2805-3","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327","date":"2024-03-27","original_code":"746.2805(3)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"Prohibited Punishments - Grabbing and Pulling: This standard was found deficient as part of a DFPS investigation.   A caregiver was observed on video to forcefully grab a child and place the child forcefully in a chair.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026574454","violation_type_title":"Prohibited Punishments - Grabbing and Pulling (26 TAC §746.2805(3))","topic_label":"Other"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1201-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327","date":"2024-03-27","original_code":"746.1201(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control: This standard was found deficient as part of a DFPS investigation.   The caregiver did not demonstrate good judgment when using excessive force and inappropriate discipline children.    The second caregiver did not demonstrate good judgment by not intervene and report to management as she was present in the classroom while her co-worker uses excessive force and inappropriately discipline children.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026574456","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Employees and Caregivers -Demonstrate Competency, Good Judgment, Self-control (26 TAC §746.1201(1))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2805-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20240327","date":"2024-03-27","original_code":"746.2805(2)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-22","finding":"Prohibited Punishments -  Associated with Food, Naps, or Toilet Training: This standard was found deficient as part of a DFPS investigation.   A caregiver admitted to leaving children sitting on a potty chair for 30 minutes at a time, while potty training.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026574453","violation_type_title":"Prohibited Punishments -  Associated with Food, Naps, or Toilet Training (26 TAC §746.2805(2))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20231030","date":"2023-10-30","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905796578","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905796578","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2023-10-30","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20231019","date":"2023-10-19","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":2,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905796577","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905796577","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2023-10-19","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1082688-i20231019-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-401-2","inspe